{"id":85700195684326,"name":"NEW [BETA] Mount Setapak ","desc":"🌿 Mount Setapak – A Realistic Hiking Simulation\nMount Setapak is a solo hiking simulation set in a peaceful forest environment, designed to give players an immersive and realistic mountain trail experience.\nFollow a winding forest trail, cross wooden bridges, pass waterfalls, and reach a basecamp before continuing toward the summit.\n\n🗺️ Gameplay Features:\n🌲 Realistic forest trail navigation\n💧 Natural terrain with ponds and waterfalls\n🏕️ Basecamp system before summit progression\n🚶 Slow-paced, immersive hiking mechanics\n🏔️ Summit tracking system - reach 100 summits to unlock the hidden Trail 100 challenge\n\n⚠️ Notes:\n😌 No enemies or combat - purely exploration and hiking-focused\n🎧 Recommended to play with sound on for full immersion\n\nMount Setapak — a realistic hiking journey, one step at a time.","path":"/game/85700195684326-mount-setapak","slug":"85700195684326-mount-setapak","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a091e41e18eba9a62d69f96d6a94f5ec1bf906a0289361475955f391add47223.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-05e471cbc37871b5fc3a2a6cee99705a/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":7,"visitor":584995,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-02-06T08:13:04.199Z","creator":{"name":"Lonwert","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"NEW-BETA-Mount-Setapak-INSTANT-SUMMIT-103425","_id":"6985a29064879f8f6fd95be7","title":"INSTANT SUMMIT","game":{"_id":"6985a29064879f8f6fd95be4","gameId":85700195684326,"name":"NEW [BETA] Mount Setapak ","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":85700195684326},"features":"INSTANT SUMMIT MOUNT SETAPAK","tags":[],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xploitforceofficial-stack/setapak-instant3/refs/heads/main/instantsu